{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id1445776971"}, "name":{"label":"SlartibartfastOfMagrathea"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-06-23T08:15:14-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"9.1.3"}, "id":{"label":"10064429225"}, "title":{"label":"Love the UI but functionality doesn’t cut it for me"}, "content":{"label":"The app looks great and I was happy to purchase app that doesn’t collect a bunch of unnecessary personal info, which most of the other similar apps do. \n\nHowever, the functionality is a bit clumsy, to me. Controls and settings aren’t as intuitive as they could be and the timed activities don’t work like I thought they would. As such, the app doesn’t fit my use case and I won’t be using it.  \n\nThe potential is there and it’s probably great in its current state for a lot of folks, but unfortunately, I’m not one of them.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
