{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id1360927179"}, "name":{"label":"Panabangi"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-01-07T21:50:51-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.2.0"}, "id":{"label":"8216737681"}, "title":{"label":"Lacks Options"}, "content":{"label":"I need this app to push me to the point of uncomfortability. Please give us the option to set alarms that will make my phone flash, vibrate, and scream like it's in a club because the banners and pings aren't enough. \n\nAlso, having four pages is great, wish we could categorize task based on self-made labels (which would be more useful if we had a 100 tasks to sift through, which is also another update I'd personally welcome). Everything else is great though, thank you for all the effort you put into this devs!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
