{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id27111986"}, "name":{"label":"da_knee"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-01-06T10:17:37-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.2.0"}, "id":{"label":"8211495810"}, "title":{"label":"Syncing not great"}, "content":{"label":"I really like this app and am happy to have it on my mac. Unfortunately, the syncing isn't always consistent – most often it is the step counts that for some reason aren't syncing. In order to get it to sync, I need to close the app and then re-open it…not great.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id254641311"}, "name":{"label":"Brbbles"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2021-12-09T08:52:37-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.1.9"}, "id":{"label":"8112114156"}, "title":{"label":"Great, but it’s missing something."}, "content":{"label":"I like this app and it’s vast customization, however, what’s the point of having 1 task that needs 2/3 completions if it only tracks it if it is entirely complete? I’d like to see when I’m only completing half the task and when I’m completing it entirely.\n\nAnd example of this is, let’s say you have “brush your teeth” as a Streak and you want it to require 2 completions (brushing in the morning and in the evening). Well, if you complete just one of those, it doesn’t count for anything and will not show up in the overall graph. Let’s say you went awhile only brushing your teeth in the morning, well, that’s as good as not doing it at all because it doesn’t “track” partial completions.\n\nThere’s got to be a way to integrate this into the app, it’s a good way to visualize when you are doing well vs. doing ok vs. doing poorly.\n\nOtherwise, the app is easy on the eyes, but the widgets are pretty ugly, I don’t know how to tackle that one hah!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
